#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " medical knowledge, but it was FREE!"
msgstr " 의술이 늘진 않았지만, 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally just comes off as creepy, even by the standards of the EZ Medical College: Creepy Murder Shack Campus. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 의도치 않게 그냥 소름 끼치는 사람이 되어 버린다. EZ 의과대학: 소름 끼치는 살인 오두막 캠퍼스 기준으로 봐도 말이다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" learns new things about emergency medical care from the knowledgeable "
"filth-man."
msgstr "은(는) 박식한 지저분남에게서 응급 처치에 대해 새로운 걸 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Although the filthy professor was a great teacher, "
msgstr "지저분한 교수는 훌륭한 선생이었지만, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " didn't learn anything new."
msgstr "은(는) 새로 배운 게 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:307
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "The entire group gets medical training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 의료 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Who should get the medical training?"
msgstr "의료 훈련은 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" somehow manages to say something like SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT in a weird "
"animal voice."
msgstr "은(는) 어째서인지 이상한 동물 목소리로 '말로 해, 침 튀기지 말고' 비슷한 말을 해낸다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " to the overalls man."
msgstr " - 멜빵바지 남자에게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "He nods with sage wisdom. Maybe he misheard "
msgstr "그는 현자처럼 고개를 끄덕인다. 혹시 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"? He proceeds to teach incredible zombie survival medical techniques the "
"likes of which have never been seen."
msgstr "의 말을 잘못 들었나? 그는 지금껏 본 적 없는 놀라운 좀비 생존 의료 기술을 가르쳐 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " -> MEDICAL SKILL MAXED OUT!"
msgstr " -> 의술 최대치!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "*YOU* DON'T SAY IT OR SPRAY IT! AAAAAAAARGH!"
msgstr "*너야말로* 말로 하지도 침 튀기지도 마! 으아아아아악!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe is infuriated! "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 격분한다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:331
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:398
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " is forced to leave."
msgstr "은(는) 떠날 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:336
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "EZ Medical College"
msgstr "EZ 의과대학"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " discovers an unsettling and filthy shack. It has a sign that says "
msgstr "은(는) 불안하고 지저분한 오두막을 발견한다. 문 위에 비뚤게 걸린 간판에는 이렇게 적혀 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "EZ MEDICAL COLLEGE"
msgstr "EZ 의과대학"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" hanging crookedly over the door.\r\n"
"\tInside is an unsettling and filthy dude in overalls.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t안에는 멜빵바지를 입은 불안하고 지저분한 남자가 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:339
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "WELL? WHO WANTS TO LEARN ABOUT SURGERY?"
msgstr "그래서? 수술 배우고 싶은 사람?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " gets FREE training in the art and science of anti-zombie engineering!"
msgstr "은(는) 대좀비 공학의 기술과 과학을 공짜로 배운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " mechanical skill, but it was FREE!"
msgstr " 기계 능력치가 늘진 않았지만, 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" gets a crash course in repair, effective barricades, and other anti-zombie "
"engineering!"
msgstr "은(는) 수리, 효과적인 바리케이드, 기타 대좀비 공학의 속성 강의를 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " didn't learn anything new. "
msgstr "은(는) 새로 배운 게 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " was already aware of all the stuff the mechanic could teach."
msgstr "는 정비공이 가르칠 수 있는 건 이미 다 알고 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "The entire group gets mechanic training!"
msgstr "일행 전체가 정비 훈련을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:390
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " farts really loudly at the mechanic, in a low pitch."
msgstr "은(는) 정비공을 향해 낮은 음으로 엄청 크게 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " to the mechanic."
msgstr " - 정비공에게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "She finds this hilarious! Delighted, the mechanic pledges to give "
msgstr "그녀는 이게 너무 웃기다! 신이 난 정비공은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " an intense crash course in absolutely everything she knows."
msgstr "에게 자기가 아는 모든 걸 집중 속성 강의로 가르쳐 주겠다고 약속한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " -> MECHANICAL SKILL MAXED OUT!"
msgstr " -> 기계 최대치!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:398
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"She responds to this by digging into her pockets for a bolt, then throwing "
"it at "
msgstr "그녀는 대답 대신 주머니를 뒤져 볼트를 꺼내 던진다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:398
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ". She continues doing this, not saying a word, until "
msgstr ". 한마디도 없이 계속 던진다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Who should get the mechanic's training?"
msgstr "정비 훈련은 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Mechanic Savant"
msgstr "정비의 달인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" meets a woman wearing oil stained coveralls.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 기름 얼룩진 작업복을 입은 여자를 만난다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"I can help you get better at repairing and building stuff. It's a real handy"
" skill. Might save your life."
msgstr "수리하고 만드는 실력을 키워 줄 수 있어. 진짜 쓸모 있는 기술이야. 목숨을 구할지도 몰라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIf nothing else, it would make car repairs easier."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t적어도 차 수리는 쉬워질 거다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:435
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" drops some food into the window and a grenade comes out. This could cause a lot of damage!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 식량을 넣고, 수류탄 하나가 나온다. 엄청난 피해를 줄 수 있다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Wait, was the pin still on?"
msgstr "잠깐, 안전핀 아직 꽂혀 있었나?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:441
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" drops some food into the window and a bunch of grenades plop out, one at a time. These can come in handy!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 식량을 넣고, 수류탄 여러 개가 하나씩 툭툭 떨어진다. 쓸모가 있을 거다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Please don't drop any of those back into here."
msgstr "제발 그거 다시 이 안으로 떨어뜨리지 마."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:447
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" drops a lot of food into the window. Someone pushes an uzi back out! It can spray out bullets at an incredible speed! Watch out, even a skilled shooter will have trouble with the recoil.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 식량을 잔뜩 넣는다. 누군가 우지를 밀어 내보낸다! 엄청난 속도로 총알을 뿜어낸다! 조심해라, 숙련된 사수도 반동을 감당하기 힘들다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:448
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Have fun! Also please go away."
msgstr "재밌게 써! 그리고 제발 좀 가 줘."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:453
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a very large amount of food into the window. There's a pause, then someone pushes an assault rifle through! This could really help the trip!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 아주 많은 식량을 밀어 넣는다. 잠시 후, 누군가 돌격소총을 밀어 낸다! 여정에 큰 도움이 될 거다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Thanks for all the food! Good luck out there!"
msgstr "식량 고마워! 밖에서 행운을 빌어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a very large amount of food into the window. There's a pause, then someone beyond the door starts pushing a dozen grenades back through.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 아주 많은 식량을 밀어 넣는다. 잠시 후, 문 너머의 누군가가 수류탄 열두 개를 밀어 내보내기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:460
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Be really careful with these!"
msgstr "이거 진짜 조심해서 다뤄!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:465
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" feeds a massive amount of food into the window. Someone on the other side of the door strains to push a flamethrower through the little window.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창구에 어마어마한 양의 식량을 밀어 넣는다. 문 건너편의 누군가가 낑낑대며 작은 창구로 화염방사기를 밀어 낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:466
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Light them up!"
msgstr "다 태워 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" slowly feeds a car-load of food into the window. Scraping noises are heard and then a minigun barrel is pushed through from the darkness. The frame of the window is broken due to the size of the minigun as it's jammed through.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 한 대 분량의 식량을 천천히 창구에 밀어 넣는다. 긁히는 소리가 나더니 어둠 속에서 미니건 총열이 밀려 나온다. 미니건이 너무 커서 억지로 밀어 넣다가 창틀이 부서진다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:472
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Thanks so much! I can hide in here for months now!"
msgstr "정말 고마워! 이제 여기서 몇 달은 숨어 지낼 수 있겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Army Surplus Fort"
msgstr "군용품 요새"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds an army surplus store, covered in barricades. It's locked tight. There's a sign of weapon prices on a wall outside, next to a small window.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 바리케이드로 뒤덮인 군용품 가게를 발견한다. 단단히 잠겨 있다. 바깥벽의 작은 창구 옆에 무기 가격표가 붙어 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:479
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Just drop the food in the window!"
msgstr "창구에 식량을 넣기만 해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:479
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " says a tiny voice in the darkness."
msgstr " 어둠 속에서 작은 목소리가 들린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "There isn't enough food to buy anything that they are selling! "
msgstr "파는 물건을 살 만한 식량이 부족하다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " has to leave."
msgstr "은(는) 떠나야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Minigun for 75 food"
msgstr "미니건 - 식량 75"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:488
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 60 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 60"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "12 grenades for 40 food"
msgstr "수류탄 12개 - 식량 40"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:494
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:647
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Assault Rifle for 25 food"
msgstr "돌격소총 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:497
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Uzi for 15 food"
msgstr "우지 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "3 grenades for 12 food"
msgstr "수류탄 3개 - 식량 12"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "1 grenade for 4 food"
msgstr "수류탄 1개 - 식량 4"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:512
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " farts right in front of the shotgun guy."
msgstr "은(는) 샷건 남자 바로 앞에서 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:514
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the shotgun guy to "
msgstr "은(는) 샷건 남자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:514
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:593
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:673
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:770
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:848
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1001
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:517
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"This causes him some sort of emotional crisis.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"이 말에 그는 무슨 감정적 위기를 겪는다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:518
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "You're right! What am I even doing with my life?!"
msgstr "네 말이 맞아! 난 대체 인생을 뭐 하며 사는 거지?!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:518
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1005
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:519
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " his "
msgstr "에게 자기 것을 건넨다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "automatic shotgun and a bunch of shells!"
msgstr "자동 샷건과 산탄 한 무더기!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "rifled slug shotgun and a bunch of shells!"
msgstr "슬러그 샷건과 산탄 한 무더기!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:524
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The peddler is really annoyed by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"행상인은 이 말에 엄청 짜증을 낸다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:525
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I'm trying to make a living here!"
msgstr "나 여기서 먹고살려고 하는 중이라고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:525
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe then refuses to sell "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그러고는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:526
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " anything."
msgstr "에게 아무것도 팔지 않겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:531
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:608
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:784
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys the "
msgstr "은(는) 산다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:531
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
". It's a one of a kind custom shotgun! Every shot is a massive blast of "
"zombie splattering."
msgstr ". 세상에 하나뿐인 커스텀 샷건이다! 한 발 한 발이 좀비를 산산이 터뜨리는 거대한 폭발이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:536
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a rifled slug shotgun. It fires a heavy, solid slug instead of "
"buckshot. A skilled shooter could destroy a solid line of zombies with each "
"shot!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 슬러그 샷건을 산다. 산탄 대신 무겁고 단단한 슬러그를 쏜다. 숙련된 사수라면 한 발에 좀비 한 줄을 통째로 날려 버릴 수 "
"있다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an automatic shotgun. This weapon fires way faster than a normal "
"shotgun, though the power of a single shot is a little weaker."
msgstr "은(는) 자동 샷건을 산다. 보통 샷건보다 훨씬 빨리 쏘지만, 한 발의 위력은 조금 약하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:546
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys a shotgun. The peddler throws in some shells for free!"
msgstr "은(는) 샷건을 산다. 행상인이 산탄을 덤으로 좀 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Shotgun Peddler"
msgstr "샷건 행상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:552
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" stops for awhile at a small settlement. No one is trusting of outsiders, everyone seems very cold and silent.\r\n"
"\tOnly one voice can be heard booming out:\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 작은 정착지에 잠시 머문다. 아무도 외지인을 믿지 않고, 다들 차갑고 말이 없다.\r\n"
"\t단 한 목소리만 쩌렁쩌렁 울린다:\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "SHOTGUNS FOR SALE! SHOTGUNS FOR SAAAALE!"
msgstr "샷건 팝니다! 샷건 팝니다아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:557
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:812
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1042
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells him to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 그에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough food to buy anything! Out of pity, the peddler gives "
msgstr "살 식량이 부족하다! 행상인은 불쌍해서 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " some free shotgun shells."
msgstr "에게 샷건 탄약을 공짜로 좀 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "BIG DAWG for 50 food"
msgstr "BIG DAWG - 식량 50"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Slug Shotgun for 40 food"
msgstr "슬러그 샷건 - 식량 40"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:569
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Autoshotty for 30 food"
msgstr "자동 샷건 - 식량 30"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "75 shells for 15 food"
msgstr "산탄 75발 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Shotgun for 10 food"
msgstr "샷건 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "50 shells for 10 food"
msgstr "산탄 50발 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:581
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "25 shells for 5 food"
msgstr "산탄 25발 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:591
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " takes a look at the collection and then rolls "
msgstr "은(는) 수집품을 한번 보더니 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:591
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " eyes."
msgstr " 눈을 굴린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the friendly woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 친절한 여자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:596
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"She nods in agreement.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그녀는 동의하며 고개를 끄덕인다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think my collection is getting too big. Mind just taking some off my"
" hands?"
msgstr "그래, 내 수집품이 너무 많아지긴 했어. 몇 개 좀 가져가 줄래?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe collector gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t수집가는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " a scoped hunting rifle and an "
msgstr "에게 조준경 달린 사냥총과 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "assault rifle."
msgstr "돌격소총을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The rifle collector seems hurt by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"소총 수집가는 상처받은 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I... I am cool..."
msgstr "나... 나 진정하고 있는데..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe then tells "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그러고는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " to leave."
msgstr "에게 떠나라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "MINIGUN"
msgstr "미니건"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
". The collector seems glad to sell it. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 수집가는 기꺼이 판다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"Well, technically it's not a rifle! And I couldn't figure out how to hang it"
" on my wall, so..."
msgstr "엄밀히 말하면 이건 소총이 아니잖아! 그리고 벽에 거는 방법을 도저히 모르겠더라고, 그래서..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:614
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a high powered hunting rifle. The collector gives you a great price on it, as she already has several.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 고성능 사냥총을 산다. 수집가는 이미 여러 자루가 있어서 아주 싸게 넘겨준다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The great thing about hunting rifles is that one shot can splat a lot of "
"zombies. My record is 7 in one shot!"
msgstr "사냥총의 좋은 점은 한 발로 좀비를 여럿 터뜨릴 수 있다는 거야. 내 기록은 한 발에 7마리!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an assault rifle. Nearly as powerful as a cowboy rifle per shot, and it fires much faster.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 돌격소총을 산다. 한 발의 위력은 카우보이 소총과 맞먹으면서, 훨씬 빨리 쏜다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"I prefer the single shot rifles, personally. Automatics use up too much ammo"
" and don't pierce as well."
msgstr "난 개인적으로 단발 소총이 좋아. 자동소총은 탄약을 너무 많이 먹고 관통력도 떨어지거든."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:626
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a cowboy rifle. The collector throws in some ammo for free, along with a second rifle!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 카우보이 소총을 산다. 수집가는 탄약 조금과 소총 한 자루를 더 덤으로 준다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"Cowboy rifles are great for beginners. Easy to handle, fun to shoot. I find "
"tons of these, so take two!"
msgstr "카우보이 소총은 초보자한테 딱이야. 다루기 쉽고 쏘는 재미가 있지. 이건 엄청 많이 주워서, 두 자루 가져가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Rifle Collector"
msgstr "소총 수집가"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" stops for awhile at an apartment building. It has been turned into a small fort by a peaceful group of survivors.\r\n"
"\tOne invites you to check out her collection of rifles.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 아파트 건물에 잠시 머문다. 평화로운 생존자 무리가 작은 요새로 개조한 곳이다.\r\n"
"\t그중 한 명이 자기 소총 수집품을 구경해 보라고 권한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I've gotten so many that I'm looking to sell one!"
msgstr "너무 많이 모아서 하나 팔려고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:638
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:725
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells her to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 그녀에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough food to buy any! To be friendly, the collector gives "
msgstr "살 식량이 부족하다! 수집가는 친절하게도 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " some free rifle ammo."
msgstr "에게 소총 탄약을 공짜로 좀 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:644
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Minigun for 65 food"
msgstr "미니건 - 식량 65"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Hunting Rifle for 20 food"
msgstr "사냥총 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "90 rifle ammo for 15 food"
msgstr "소총 탄약 90발 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:656
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Cowboy Rifle for 10 food"
msgstr "카우보이 소총 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:659
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "60 rifle ammo for 10 food"
msgstr "소총 탄약 60발 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:662
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "30 rifle ammo for 5 food"
msgstr "소총 탄약 30발 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " says the phrase "
msgstr "은(는) 방귀로 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "COOL IT"
msgstr "진정해"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " by farting! Amazing!"
msgstr "! 놀랍다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:673
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the fanatical woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 광신적인 여자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:676
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"She's delighted by this, somehow.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"어째선지 그녀는 이 말에 기뻐한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:677
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "WHOA!\tWHOAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "우와!\t우와아아아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:677
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe trader gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:678
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " nearly her entire stock. 8 molotovs, a parking meter, and a "
msgstr "에게 재고를 거의 다 준다. 화염병 8개, 주차 미터기, 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:678
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "chainsaw."
msgstr "전기톱."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:681
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The weapons trader is infuriated by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"무기 상인은 이 말에 격분한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:682
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT? COOL IT??! LOSERS COOL IT!!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"진정하라고? 진정하라고??! 찐따들이나 진정해!!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" realizes that this was a pretty bad idea! The trader signals the rest of "
"her group to attack!"
msgstr "은(는) 이게 꽤 나쁜 생각이었다는 걸 깨닫는다! 상인이 무리의 나머지에게 공격 신호를 보낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:688
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a couple of molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 두 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "A little fire can go a long way!"
msgstr "작은 불씨가 큰일을 하지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:693
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys five molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 다섯 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:694
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "When in doubt, burn it all down!!"
msgstr "애매할 땐, 다 태워 버려!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:698
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys eight molotov cocktails.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염병 여덟 개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:699
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Don't use them all in one place!"
msgstr "한곳에 다 쓰지 마!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:703
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a parking meter? It's very heavy.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 주차 미터기를 산다? 아주 무겁다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:704
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"We ripped this out of the ground! That's how we can pass the savings on to "
"you!"
msgstr "우리가 땅에서 직접 뽑아 왔어! 그래서 이렇게 싸게 줄 수 있는 거지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:708
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a chainsaw! It converts spare gas into zombie destruction.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 전기톱을 산다! 남는 기름을 좀비 파괴로 바꿔 준다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:709
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Hahaha! PERFECT! Rip them all apart!"
msgstr "하하하! 완벽해! 전부 갈기갈기 찢어 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:713
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a flamethrower! Try not to shoot your team members with it.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염방사기를 산다! 팀원한테 쏘지 않도록 조심해라.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:714
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Aaaaaaa! Looks GREAT on you!!"
msgstr "아아아아아! 너한테 완전 잘 어울려!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:720
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Carnage Weapons"
msgstr "학살 무기점"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:721
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles into the camp of a large group of intimidating people. They're dressed somewhere between biker gang and 80's post apocalypse movie.\r\n"
"\tOne particularly intense looking woman offers to sell you a spare weapon. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 위협적인 사람들의 큰 무리가 있는 캠프에 발을 들인다. 옷차림이 폭주족과 80년대 포스트 아포칼립스 영화 그 중간쯤이다.\r\n"
"\t유난히 강렬해 보이는 여자가 남는 무기를 팔겠다고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:722
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I only carry the BEST stuff!"
msgstr "난 최고급만 취급해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:728
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough food to buy any! The trader gives a free molotov to "
msgstr "살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 좀비 파괴를 장려하는 차원에서 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:728
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ", just to promote zombie destruction."
msgstr "에게 화염병 하나를 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:731
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 50 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 50"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:734
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Chainsaw for 20 food"
msgstr "전기톱 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "8 molotovs for 15 food"
msgstr "화염병 8개 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Parking meter for 10 food"
msgstr "주차 미터기 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:743
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "5 molotovs for 10 food"
msgstr "화염병 5개 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:746
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "2 molotovs for 5 food"
msgstr "화염병 2개 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:757
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the Blade Master of two of his best weapons. Both are powerful melee "
"weapons in their own way."
msgstr "은(는) 칼날 달인에게서 가장 좋은 무기 두 개를 턴다. 둘 다 저마다 강력한 근접 무기다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:759
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1066
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1150
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1213
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1273
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1333
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1393
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1453
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1540
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " dragged into it."
msgstr " 함께 휘말린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "The Blade Master manages to fight off "
msgstr "칼날 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " using his considerable sword knowledge and mall katana."
msgstr "을(를) 물리친다. 상당한 검술 지식과 쇼핑몰 카타나로."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:768
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " starts gnawing on one of the Blade Master's scabbards, in spite."
msgstr "은(는) 앙심을 품고 칼날 달인의 칼집 하나를 갉아먹기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the Blade Master to "
msgstr "은(는) 칼날 달인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:773
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"He becomes filled with self-doubt.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그는 자기 회의에 휩싸인다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:774
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"My life is a lie! I'm going to give up this sword stuff and start collecting"
" flamethrowers."
msgstr "내 인생은 거짓이었어! 칼 같은 건 그만두고 화염방사기나 모아야겠다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:774
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe former Blade Master gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t전직 칼날 달인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:775
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " two of his best weapons. They are a sturdy machete and a "
msgstr "에게 가장 좋은 무기 두 개를 준다. 튼튼한 마체테와 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:775
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Knight's Sword."
msgstr "기사의 검."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:778
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The Blade Master ignores this.\r\n"
"\t\tHe starts talking about how cool swords are and "
msgstr ""
"칼날 달인은 이 말을 무시한다.\r\n"
"\t\t그는 칼이 얼마나 멋진지 늘어놓기 시작하고, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:779
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " never gets a chance to buy anything."
msgstr "은(는) 뭘 살 기회조차 얻지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "MIGHTY CLAYMORE"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
". The claymore is slow and hard to handle, but extremely powerful. It can "
"sometimes chop 4 zombies at once!"
msgstr ". 클레이모어는 느리고 다루기 어렵지만, 엄청나게 강력하다. 가끔 좀비 4마리를 한꺼번에 베어 버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys the type of sword a knight in the middle ages would use. This will "
"make a great weapon! It can easily hit two zombies in one swing."
msgstr "은(는) 중세 기사가 쓸 법한 검을 산다. 훌륭한 무기가 될 거다! 한 번 휘둘러 좀비 둘을 쉽게 벨 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a very strong yet light machete. It's sturdy enough to chop down trees"
" with, so it won't break with 'road trip usage'."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 튼튼하면서도 가벼운 마체테를 산다. 나무를 벨 만큼 튼튼해서 '여행용'으로 써도 부러지지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a katana of the type you'd get at a mall. It looks like it might break"
" at any moment. What a rip off."
msgstr "은(는) 쇼핑몰에서 살 법한 카타나를 산다. 당장이라도 부러질 것 같다. 완전 바가지다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:804
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Blade Master"
msgstr "칼날 달인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:805
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" meets a man shuffling down the road. He's carrying many swords in scabbards or tied to his pack.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길을 터벅터벅 걷는 남자를 만난다. 칼집에 넣거나 배낭에 묶은 칼을 잔뜩 지니고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:806
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"One day I'll make the finest zombie slicing sword ever seen! Though I have "
"to figure out how to make swords first. I just found these lying around. "
"I'll sell you one!"
msgstr ""
"언젠가 세상에서 가장 훌륭한 좀비 베기용 검을 만들 거야! 근데 일단 검 만드는 법부터 알아내야 해. 이건 그냥 주운 거야. 하나 팔게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:809
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1039
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1122
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1187
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1248
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1308
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1368
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1428
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs the trader"
msgstr "이(가) 상인을 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:815
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough food to buy anything! As consolation the trader gives "
msgstr "살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 위로 삼아 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:815
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " a butcher's cleaver."
msgstr "에게 정육점 식칼을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:818
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Mighty Claymore for 35 food"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어 - 식량 35"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:821
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Knight's Sword for 25 food"
msgstr "기사의 검 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Sturdy Machete for 15 food"
msgstr "튼튼한 마체테 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:827
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Cheap Katana for 5 food"
msgstr "싸구려 카타나 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:836
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the axe merchant, who simply stands there without responding at all. "
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 상인을 턴다. 상인은 아무 반응도 없이 그냥 서 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:836
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" grabs the medieval axe but is too creeped out to steal a second thing. "
msgstr "은(는) 중세 도끼를 집어 들지만, 너무 소름 끼쳐서 두 번째 물건은 못 훔친다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:838
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " also creeped out."
msgstr " 역시 소름 끼쳐 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:841
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The axe merchant moves way too fast for its appearance. In a flash, it is "
"holding a huge medieval axe in one robed hand. "
msgstr "도끼 상인은 겉모습과 달리 너무 빠르게 움직인다. 눈 깜짝할 새에 로브 입은 한 손에 거대한 중세 도끼를 쥐고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:841
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " is far too terrified to continue the robbery attempt."
msgstr "은(는) 너무 겁에 질려 강도질을 계속할 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:846
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " rips an especially loud fart."
msgstr "은(는) 유난히 큰 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:848
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the axe merchant to "
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:851
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"The axe merchant doesn't seem to react.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"도끼 상인은 아무 반응이 없어 보인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " has no idea if "
msgstr "은(는) 알 수 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " was heard or not."
msgstr "의 말이 들렸는지 아닌지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "MEDIEVAL AXE"
msgstr "중세 도끼"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
". This thing is really heavy and slow. It can often cleave 3 zombies at "
"once! Give it to someone strong and fit."
msgstr ". 이건 정말 무겁고 느리다. 한 번에 좀비 3마리를 쪼개는 일도 흔하다! 힘세고 체력 좋은 사람에게 줘라."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:863
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys an axe-shaped guitar. This would make a stylish weapon."
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 모양 기타를 산다. 멋스러운 무기가 될 거다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a fire axe. It's called this because it was what firefighters used to "
"chop up zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 소방 도끼를 산다. 소방관들이 좀비를 쪼갤 때 쓰던 거라 이런 이름이 붙었다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:873
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys a hatchet. It's the tiniest little axe."
msgstr "은(는) 손도끼를 산다. 세상에서 제일 조그만 도끼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:878
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Axe Merchant"
msgstr "도끼 상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:879
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" meets a strange figure shuffling down the road. It's wearing a hooded robe and pulling a cart full of different types of axes.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길을 터벅터벅 걷는 이상한 형체를 만난다. 후드 달린 로브를 입고, 온갖 종류의 도끼가 가득한 수레를 끌고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I sell axes... Just axes..."
msgstr "도끼를 판다... 도끼만..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:883
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs the merchant"
msgstr "이(가) 상인을 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:886
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells it to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 그것에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:889
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There isn't enough food to buy anything! As consolation the merchant gives "
msgstr "살 식량이 부족하다! 상인은 위로 삼아 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:889
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " a hockey stick, which I guess is axe shaped."
msgstr "에게 하키 스틱을 준다. 뭐, 도끼 모양이긴 하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:892
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Medieval Axe for 25 food"
msgstr "중세 도끼 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:895
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Electric Guitar for 10 food"
msgstr "일렉 기타 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:898
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Fire Axe for 6 food"
msgstr "소방 도끼 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:901
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Hatchet for 3 food"
msgstr "손도끼 - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:909
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a flamethrower. The traders don't say where they got it. Try not to "
"set yourself on fire with this!"
msgstr "은(는) 화염방사기를 산다. 상인들은 어디서 구했는지 말하지 않는다. 자기 몸에 불붙이지 않게 조심해라!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:914
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an automatic shotgun. NOW we're talking! You're set until you run out "
"of shells for it."
msgstr "은(는) 자동 샷건을 산다. 이제야 말이 통하네! 산탄이 떨어질 때까지는 든든하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:919
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an assault rifle. Whoever uses this needs a lot of shooting skill to "
"handle it right!"
msgstr "은(는) 돌격소총을 산다. 제대로 다루려면 사격 실력이 많이 필요하다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:924
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an uzi. Great for spraying bullets EVERYWHERE. Even someone great with"
" guns will have problems handling this."
msgstr "은(는) 우지를 산다. 사방에 총알을 뿌리기에 딱이다. 총을 잘 다루는 사람도 감당하기 힘들 거다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:930
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "The traders decide to show "
msgstr "상인들은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:930
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " THE GOOD STUFF."
msgstr "에게 진짜 좋은 물건을 보여 주기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:933
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Flamethrower for 40 food"
msgstr "화염방사기 - 식량 40"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:936
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Auto-Shotgun for 25 food"
msgstr "자동 샷건 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:939
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Assault Rifle for 20 food"
msgstr "돌격소총 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:942
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Uzi for 10 food"
msgstr "우지 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:947
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a shotgun. What a classic choice! This weapon is good in the hands of "
"nearly anyone."
msgstr "은(는) 샷건을 산다. 고전적인 선택이다! 거의 누가 써도 좋은 무기다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:952
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a cowboy rifle. Just like the cowboys used. Someone with good shooting"
" skill could really make this work."
msgstr "은(는) 카우보이 소총을 산다. 카우보이들이 쓰던 그대로다. 사격 실력이 좋은 사람이라면 제대로 써먹을 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:957
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a revolver. In the right hands, this could let someone using cheap "
"bullets do a lot of zombie damage."
msgstr "은(는) 리볼버를 산다. 제대로 쓰면 싼 총알로도 좀비에게 큰 피해를 줄 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:962
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a pistol. It was very cheap, but this is the same type one can find "
"anywhere."
msgstr "은(는) 권총을 산다. 아주 쌌지만, 어디서나 볼 수 있는 흔한 종류다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:967
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Mobile Gun Show"
msgstr "이동식 총기 박람회"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:968
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a large band of travelling survivors. They are trading firearms, "
"though the selection seems like pretty common stuff."
msgstr "은(는) 떠돌아다니는 생존자 큰 무리를 발견한다. 총기를 거래하고 있는데, 물건은 꽤 흔한 것들인 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:971
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " demands to see the good stuff"
msgstr "이(가) 좋은 물건을 보여 달라고 요구한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:977
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Shotgun for 5 food"
msgstr "샷건 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:980
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Cowboy Rifle for 5 food"
msgstr "카우보이 소총 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:983
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Revolver for 5 food"
msgstr "리볼버 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:985
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Pistol for 1 food"
msgstr "권총 - 식량 1"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:993
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"At the first glimmer of trouble, the trader opens his coat to reveal that he's covered in pipebombs. In a quick motion, he lights a fuse on one of them.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"문제의 기미가 보이자마자, 상인이 코트를 열어젖힌다. 온몸에 파이프 폭탄이 붙어 있다. 그는 재빠르게 그중 하나에 불을 붙인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:994
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" is right next to him, and has just barely enough time to deeply regret the "
"whole robbery thing."
msgstr "은(는) 바로 그 옆에 있었고, 강도질 자체를 뼈저리게 후회할 시간이 겨우 있을 뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:999
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " farts really loud at the pipebomb guy."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 남자를 향해 엄청 크게 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1001
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the pipebomb guy to "
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 남자에게 말한다: "

