msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "He interprets this as "
msgstr "그는 이걸 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1004
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" playing hardball with the trade.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 거래에서 세게 나오는 걸로 받아들인다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1005
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "NO! TAKE MY BOMBS! FREE SAMPLES!"
msgstr "안 돼! 내 폭탄 가져가! 무료 샘플이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1006
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " 25 pipebombs! That's a massive amount!"
msgstr "에게 파이프 폭탄 25개를 준다! 어마어마한 양이다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1009
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "YOU COOL IT! YOU COOL IT!!"
msgstr "너나 진정해! 너나 진정하라고!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1009
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThe mood gets pretty tense with the guy selling explosives, so "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t폭발물 파는 남자와 분위기가 꽤 험악해져서, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1015
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1075
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " The trader gives "
msgstr " 상인은 "

