msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" an extra pipebomb in an extremely awkward attempt at either flirting or "
"friendliness. It's hard to say for sure."
msgstr "에게 파이프 폭탄 하나를 더 준다. 엄청 어색한 작업 멘트인지 친절인지, 확실히 말하긴 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1019
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys 8 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 8개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1024
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys 5 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 5개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1029
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " buys 2 pipebombs."
msgstr "은(는) 파이프 폭탄 2개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1034
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Pipebomb Supplier"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 공급자"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1035
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a twitchy man selling homemade bombs. He's wearing a bulky coat with lumps bulging out from underneath.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 집에서 만든 폭탄을 파는 안절부절못하는 남자를 발견한다. 그가 입은 두툼한 코트 아래로 뭔가 울퉁불퉁 튀어나와 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1036
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "BUY MY BOMBS!"
msgstr "내 폭탄 사!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1045
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"Sadly, there isn't enough food left for trading, though he does give away a "
"free pipebomb!"
msgstr "안타깝게도 거래할 식량이 남아 있지 않지만, 그는 파이프 폭탄 하나를 공짜로 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1049
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "8 pipebombs for 15 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 8개 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1052
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "5 pipebombs for 10 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 5개 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1055
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "2 pipebombs for 5 food"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 2개 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1064
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the trader of some swords and shuriken, but smashes some perfectly "
"usable animes in the process. "
msgstr "은(는) 상인에게서 칼과 수리검을 털지만, 그 과정에서 멀쩡한 애니메이션 몇 개를 박살 낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1070
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" is foiled when the trader snaps the truck's armored shutters closed and "
"then drives away."
msgstr "은(는) 실패한다. 상인이 트럭의 장갑 셔터를 닫고 달아나 버렸다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1075
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" an extra katana.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 카타나 하나를 더 준다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1076
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "PROMOTIONAL OFFER, JUST FOR YOU! *WINK*"
msgstr "당신만을 위한 프로모션 특가! *찡긋*"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1081
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys a gigantic throwing star.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 거대한 표창을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1082
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"THIS IS THE OFFICIAL WINDSTAR USED IN THE LIVE-ACTION VERSION OF THE "
"WINDSTAR ANIME!! EXCELLENT CHOICE!"
msgstr "이건 윈드스타 애니 실사판에서 쓴 공식 윈드스타라고!! 탁월한 선택이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1089
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys an anime figurine. It seems really expensive...\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 애니 피규어를 산다. 엄청 비싸 보인다...\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1090
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "I CAN TELL YOU HAVE EXQUISITE TASTES!"
msgstr "고급 취향이시구만!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1095
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys 4 katanas.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 카타나 4자루를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1096
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "ENOUGH FOR A WHOLE GROUP! CUT THROUGH ANYTHING!"
msgstr "일행 전원이 쓸 만큼 있어! 뭐든 베어 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" buys 5 Shuriken.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 수리검 5개를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "INCREDIBLE DEAL!"
msgstr "믿을 수 없는 가격!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" destroys some anime, as a protest against the very existence of anime. The "
"anime trader gets the message."
msgstr "은(는) 애니라는 존재 자체에 항의하는 뜻으로 애니 몇 개를 부숴 버린다. 애니 상인은 메시지를 알아듣는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " tells the anime trader to "
msgstr "은(는) 애니 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT. \r\n"
"\tALSO, ANIME ISN'T REAL!"
msgstr ""
"진정해. \r\n"
"\t그리고 애니는 진짜가 아니야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"There is no way that he could take this well.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그가 이걸 좋게 받아들일 리가 없다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "NO! YOU'RE WRONG! STOP IT! NOooooooo!"
msgstr "아니야! 네가 틀렸어! 그만해! 안 돼에에에에!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe goes to his driver's seat and then peels out in anger and confusion."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 운전석으로 가더니 분노와 혼란 속에 바퀴 자국을 남기며 떠나 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "The Last Anime Sale"
msgstr "최후의 애니 세일"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
