msgid " has been crossed off its sign with "
msgstr "에는 줄이 그어져 있고, 그 위에 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "SHOTGUN SHELLS"
msgstr "샷건 탄약"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" written in.\r\n"
"\tHe offers to sell 5 shotgun shells in exchange for every food item you give him."
msgstr ""
"(이)라고 적혀 있다.\r\n"
"\t식량 하나당 산탄 5발을 팔겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs the rifle ammo seller. "
msgstr "은(는) 소총 탄약 상인을 턴다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"'s robbery attempt ends in failure when it turns out the seller also has two"
" loaded assault rifles. She fires them wildly, one in each hand, spraying "
"ammo everywhere."
msgstr ""
"의 강도 시도는 실패로 끝난다. 알고 보니 상인에게 장전된 돌격소총이 두 자루나 있었다. 그녀는 양손에 하나씩 들고 마구 쏘아 대며 "
"사방에 탄을 뿌린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 5 food for 30 rifle ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 5를 소총 탄약 30발로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 10 food for 60 rifle ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 10을 소총 탄약 60발로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 15 food for 90 rifle ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 15를 소총 탄약 90발로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1358
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " remaining food for rifle ammo."
msgstr " 남은 식량을 전부 소총 탄약으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Rifle Ammo Seller"
msgstr "소총 탄약 상인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" runs into someone selling extra rifle ammo. She says she got a big surplus because she aims carefully, often killing multiple zombies in one shot.\r\n"
"\tShe offers to give 6 rifle ammo per food item she gets."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 남는 소총 탄약을 파는 사람과 마주친다. 신중하게 조준해서 한 발에 좀비 여럿을 잡는 경우가 많아 탄약이 많이 남았다고 한다.\r\n"
"\t식량 하나당 소총 탄약 6발을 주겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the medicine salesman, though some supplies are ruined in the process."
" "
msgstr "은(는) 약장수를 털지만, 그 과정에서 물자 일부가 망가진다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the trader but later realizes that everything was just poop medicine "
"for cats."
msgstr "은(는) 상인을 털지만, 나중에 보니 전부 고양이용 변비약이었다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 5 food for 5 medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 5를 의료품 5로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 10 food for 10 medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 10을 의료품 10으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 15 food for 15 medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 15를 의료품 15로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades their remaining food for medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 남은 식량을 전부 의료품으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Medicine Salesman"
msgstr "약장수"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a man claiming to be a travelling medicine salesman. He's carrying two suitcases of medical supplies.\r\n"
"\tHe offers his wares for an even exchange of food. One medical item for each item of food."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 떠돌이 약장수라는 남자를 발견한다. 의료품이 든 여행 가방 두 개를 들고 있다.\r\n"
"\t식량과 1대 1로 바꿔 주겠다고 한다. 식량 하나에 의료품 하나."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1451
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" robs the hospital, overwhelming the defenders before they know what's going"
" on. Way to go. "
msgstr "은(는) 병원을 턴다. 방어하던 사람들이 무슨 일인지 알기도 전에 제압한다. 잘했다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1457
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" attempts to rob the hospital. Their many defenders show just how they "
"managed to survive this long."
msgstr "은(는) 병원을 털려고 한다. 수많은 방어자들이 자기들이 어떻게 지금까지 살아남았는지 똑똑히 보여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " gets a check-up, but there's nothing wrong with "
msgstr "은(는) 검진을 받지만, 아무 이상이 없다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1465
#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1481
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " gets treatment for "
msgstr "은(는) 치료받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1465
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " wounds."
msgstr " 상처를."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " gets a check-up, but there's nothing wrong with them."
msgstr "은(는) 검진을 받지만, 아무 이상이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1483
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "all"
msgstr "모든"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "most"
msgstr "대부분의"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " of their wounds."
msgstr " 상처를."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Who should get the treatment?"
msgstr "치료는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" convinces the staff of the hospital to offer their services for free!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 병원 직원들을 설득해 공짜로 치료받는다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1505
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "'s just that charming."
msgstr "는 그만큼 매력적이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " is asked to leave the hospital and never return."
msgstr "에게 병원을 떠나 다시는 오지 말라는 요청이 온다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1514
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Functional Hospital"
msgstr "제대로 돌아가는 병원"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1515
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a settlement built into a hospital. The lights are still, a few doctors are still there, and they're still open for business!\r\n"
"\tThey offer to provide health care for food. 10 food for full treatment."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 병원에 지어진 정착지를 발견한다. 아직 불이 들어오고, 의사도 몇 명 남아 있고, 여전히 영업 중이다!\r\n"
"\t식량을 받고 치료를 해 주겠다고 한다. 완전 치료에 식량 10."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1518
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Sadly, there isn't enough food for their services."
msgstr "안타깝게도 치료비로 낼 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Give 6 food for treatment"
msgstr "식량 6을 주고 치료받는다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1522
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Give 15 food for group care"
msgstr "식량 15를 주고 일행 전체 치료"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1529
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs the hospital"
msgstr "이(가) 병원을 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1538
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs some of the ammo cache, but not without a huge fight. "
msgstr "은(는) 탄약 창고 일부를 털지만, 큰 싸움을 치르고서야 가능했다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1544
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" turned out to make a really bad choice there. The guards are not happy."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 나쁜 선택을 한 것으로 밝혀진다. 경비들이 화가 났다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 5 food for a bit of ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 5를 탄약 약간으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1555
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 10 food for a bunch of ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 10을 탄약 한 무더기로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " trades 15 food for an assortment of ammo."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 15를 여러 종류의 탄약으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " remaining food for some ammo."
msgstr " 남은 식량을 전부 탄약으로 바꾼다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1570
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Ammo Emporium"
msgstr "탄약 백화점"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1571
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a plump merchant in a barricaded shop full of ammo. She is surrounded"
" by guards."
msgstr "은(는) 탄약이 가득한 바리케이드 친 가게에서 통통한 상인을 발견한다. 경비들에게 둘러싸여 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1571
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tWELCOME TO THE AMMO EMPORIUM! EVERYTHING MUST GO!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t탄약 백화점에 오신 걸 환영합니다! 전품목 정리 세일!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe offers to give 5 bullets, 4 rifle ammo, and 3 shotgun shells in exchange for every food item she gets."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t식량 하나당 총알 5발, 소총 탄약 4발, 산탄 3발을 주겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:1576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " robs the shop"
msgstr "이(가) 가게를 턴다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The witch cackles and then tells "
msgstr "마녀는 낄낄 웃더니 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " to go away."
msgstr "에게 꺼지라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " The witch gives "
msgstr " 마녀는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" a free Witch's Broom.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 마녀의 빗자루를 공짜로 준다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "MAYBE YOU CAN BE A WITCH SOMEDAY! *CACKLING*"
msgstr "너도 언젠가 마녀가 될 수 있을지도! *낄낄낄*"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" bribes the witch into joining the team!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마녀를 매수해 팀에 합류시킨다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "CAN I BRING MY CAULDRON WITH ME?"
msgstr "내 가마솥 가져가도 돼?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for the witch?"
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t마녀의 자리를 만들려면 누구를 뺄까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys a BLACK CAT...\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 검은 고양이를 산다...\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "WELL, I THINK YOU CAN HANDLE HAVING A PET!"
msgstr "음, 너희라면 반려동물 하나쯤은 감당할 수 있겠지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for the black cat?"
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t검은 고양이의 자리를 만들려면 누구를 뺄까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" buys a Witch's Broom!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마녀의 빗자루를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"THIS BROOM HAS BEEN INFUSED WITH THE POWER OF BLACK MAGIC, SO IT SWEEPS "
"TWICE AS GOOD AS A NORMAL BROOM!"
msgstr "이 빗자루엔 흑마법의 힘이 깃들어서, 보통 빗자루보다 두 배나 잘 쓸린다고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" asks the witch about her cauldron.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마녀에게 가마솥에 대해 묻는다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "YOU CAN DRINK FROM IT IF YOU WANT! IT'S VERY POISONOUS."
msgstr "원하면 마셔도 돼! 독성이 아주 강하지만."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " emits a big fart against the witch's cauldron."
msgstr "은(는) 마녀의 가마솥에 대고 큰 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " tells the witch trader to "
msgstr "은(는) 마녀 상인에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"COOL IT. \r\n"
"\tALSO, NICE CAULDRON! NOT!"
msgstr ""
"진정해. \r\n"
"\t그리고 가마솥 멋지네! 뻥이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The witch seizes "
msgstr "마녀가 붙잡는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"MAKE FUN OF THE WITCH'S BREW?\r\n"
"\t\t\tGET THROWN IN THE WITCH'S STEW!!"
msgstr ""
"마녀의 물약을 놀려?\r\n"
"\t\t\t마녀의 스튜에 던져 주마!!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The witch throws "
msgstr "마녀가 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " in the cauldron!"
msgstr "를 가마솥에 던져 넣는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " is completely engulfed in poisonous stew! Yum!"
msgstr "은(는) 독 스튜에 완전히 잠긴다! 냠냠!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " - MAX HEALTH REDUCED TO 1"
msgstr " - 최대 체력이 1로 감소"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The Witch and the Cauldron"
msgstr "마녀와 가마솥"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"You're disturbing this witch from doing witch activities.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"마녀 활동을 하는 마녀를 방해하고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"YOU CAN BOTHER ME ONCE AND ONLY ONCE, I'M BUSY WITH MY WITCH ACTIVITIES!"
msgstr "귀찮게 하는 건 딱 한 번만 허락한다, 난 마녀 활동으로 바쁘거든!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Keep quiet for now"
msgstr "일단 조용히 있는다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " tells her to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 그녀에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Ask about Cauldron"
msgstr "가마솥에 대해 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Recruit Witch for 20 food"
msgstr "마녀 영입 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Black Cat for 13 food"
msgstr "검은 고양이 - 식량 13"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Witch's Broom for 5 food"
msgstr "마녀의 빗자루 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Genetic Upgrade"
msgstr "유전자 업그레이드"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " enters the machine and gets blasted by "
msgstr "은(는) 기계에 들어가 맞는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "COSMIC RAYS"
msgstr "우주 광선"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " feels energized!"
msgstr "는 기운이 솟는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "COSMIC RAAAAAAAAYS"
msgstr "우주 과아아아아아앙선"

