msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get blasted by "
msgstr "누가 맞을까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "COSMIC RAYS?"
msgstr "우주 광선?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Kip's Science Machine"
msgstr "킵의 과학 기계"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"It's some sorta lizard alien. No one seems to mind.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"무슨 도마뱀 외계인 같다. 다들 신경 안 쓰는 눈치다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "For a small fee I can permanently mess up your genetic code! "
msgstr "약간의 수수료만 내면 네 유전자 코드를 영구적으로 엉망으로 만들어 줄게! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "75% discount for the first zap! That's a deal!"
msgstr "첫 번째 지지기는 75% 할인! 완전 이득이지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "BIG TIME!"
msgstr "엄청나게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Decline generous offer"
msgstr "후한 제안을 거절한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Sadly, you can't afford this sweet deal."
msgstr "안타깝게도 이 좋은 거래를 감당할 형편이 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Sounds good! - "
msgstr "좋아! - 식량 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:187 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:849
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " food"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get this head?"
msgstr "이 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Pick a different head"
msgstr "다른 머리를 고른다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" gets a brand new chicken head! It's infused with all the powers and "
"abilities of a chicken."
msgstr "은(는) 새 닭 머리를 받는다! 닭의 모든 힘과 능력이 깃들어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has a TINY BRAIN!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 쪼끄만 뇌를 가졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the chicken's head?"
msgstr "닭 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"A chicken isn't known for its toughness or intelligence, but then again, "
"they can flap around pretty fast."
msgstr "닭은 튼튼함이나 지능으로 유명하진 않지만, 뭐, 꽤 빠르게 퍼덕거리긴 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:229 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:249
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:269 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:290
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:313 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:337
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:356 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:376
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:399 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:419
#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:441 deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:462
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람을 고른다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " gets the head of a hero!"
msgstr "은(는) 영웅의 머리를 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " gets a more heroic attitude!"
msgstr "은(는) 더 영웅다운 태도를 갖게 된다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the hero's head?"
msgstr "영웅의 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Even floating around in a jar, this square jawed head looks like one of "
"those loyal and positive heroic types."
msgstr "병 속에 둥둥 떠 있어도, 이 각진 턱의 머리는 충직하고 긍정적인 영웅 타입처럼 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " gets a dog's head!"
msgstr "은(는) 개 머리를 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has a TINY BUT LOYAL BRAIN!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 쪼끄맣지만 충직한 뇌를 가졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the dog's head?"
msgstr "개 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Dogs are man's best friend! A dog's head would likely be a big improvement "
"over your treacherous non-dog head. As a bonus, the head is smoking a little"
" pipe."
msgstr ""
"개는 인간의 가장 좋은 친구다! 개 머리라면 배신 잘하는 너의 개 아닌 머리보다 훨씬 나을 거다. 보너스로, 이 머리는 작은 파이프 "
"담배를 피우고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has a clown's head. Nothing good could possibly come of this."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 광대 머리다. 여기서 좋은 일이 생길 리가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the clown's head?"
msgstr "광대 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor shows you a clown's head floating in a jar. It's terrifying. This"
" SEEMS like a bad idea."
msgstr "의사가 병 속에 둥둥 떠 있는 광대 머리를 보여 준다. 무시무시하다. 이건 아무래도 나쁜 생각 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " is now feeling a little gnomey."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 살짝 노움스러운 기분이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the gnome's head?"
msgstr "노움 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor offers to replace your head with a gnome. Yes, the fantasy "
"woodland creature."
msgstr "의사가 네 머리를 노움으로 바꿔 주겠다고 한다. 그래, 판타지 숲속 생물 그거."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " is some kind of cyborg. Hopefully "
msgstr "은(는) 일종의 사이보그가 됐다. 바라건대 이제 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " can now talk to the car the next time it breaks down."
msgstr "는 다음에 차가 고장 나면 차와 대화할 수 있겠지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM MECHANICAL INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 기계 능력치 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the robot's head?"
msgstr "로봇 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "The doctor shows off a stylish robot head. Become one with machines!"
msgstr "의사가 세련된 로봇 머리를 자랑한다. 기계와 하나가 되어라!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" is now infused with ALIEN INTELLIGENCE! Though, in hindsight it's likely "
"that the alien wasn't the smartest of its species."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 외계 지성으로 가득하다! 다만 돌이켜 보면, 그 외계인이 종족 중에 제일 똑똑한 개체는 아니었던 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the alien's head?"
msgstr "외계인 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor presents an alien head in a jar. THE TRUTH IS OUT THERE. The "
"alien looks like a more evolved and intelligent life form, though not so "
"evolved that it could avoid getting preserved in a little jar."
msgstr ""
"의사가 병에 든 외계인 머리를 내놓는다. 진실은 저 너머에. 이 외계인은 더 진화하고 지능이 높은 생명체 같지만, 작은 병에 보존되는 걸"
" 피할 만큼 진화하진 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " is now half beaver! This glorious symbol of Canada improves morale."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 반은 비버다! 이 영광스러운 캐나다의 상징이 사기를 높여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the beaver's head?"
msgstr "비버 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Beavers are known for their capacity for aerobic exercise. They're always "
"prancing around and doing jumping jacks. I think that's what I heard in "
"nature documentaries."
msgstr "비버는 유산소 운동 능력으로 유명하다. 늘 깡충깡충 뛰어다니며 팔벌려뛰기를 한다. 자연 다큐에서 그렇게 들은 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has a skull instead of a head. This is "
msgstr "은(는) 이제 머리 대신 해골이 달렸다. 이건 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "SO cool."
msgstr "너무 멋지다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM STRENGTH, FITNESS, AND SHOOTING INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 근력, 체력, 사격 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the skeleton's head?"
msgstr "해골 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor says he's going to bring out his BEST transplant head, and it "
"turns out to be a skull. Intriguing."
msgstr "의사가 자기 최고의 이식용 머리를 꺼내 오겠다더니, 알고 보니 해골이다. 흥미롭다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has the potential of becoming too swole to control!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 감당 못 할 만큼 우람해질 잠재력을 가졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM STRENGTH INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 근력 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the bodybuilder's head?"
msgstr "보디빌더 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:416
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"A lot of a bodybuilder's strength is from mental conditioning. So having a "
"bodybuilder's head should let you reach new heights of strength!"
msgstr "보디빌더 힘의 상당 부분은 정신 단련에서 나온다. 그러니 보디빌더 머리를 달면 새로운 힘의 경지에 오를 수 있을 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:426
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " now has all the resilience and firearms accuracy of a mall cop!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 쇼핑몰 경비원의 모든 회복력과 사격 정확도를 갖췄다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:427
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM SHOOTING DECREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 사격 감소!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:434
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the mall cop's head?"
msgstr "쇼핑몰 경비원 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:437
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"When the zomborpocalypse happens, mall cops will inherit the ruins of the earth.\r\n"
"\t-- Ancient Book of Mall Cop Prophecy"
msgstr ""
"좀비 종말이 오면, 쇼핑몰 경비원들이 지구의 폐허를 물려받으리라.\r\n"
"\t-- 쇼핑몰 경비원 예언의 고서"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:448
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " kind of feels like a real doctor. There are some doubts because "
msgstr "은(는) 진짜 의사가 된 기분이다. 다만 좀 의심스러운 건, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:448
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " didn't get the doctor outfit as part of the transplant."
msgstr "가 이식 때 의사 가운은 못 받았다는 점이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM MEDICAL INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 의술 능력치 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Who should get the mad doctor's head?"
msgstr "미친 의사의 머리는 누가 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor points at his head. He claims it's the second best one he has in "
"stock."
msgstr "의사가 자기 머리를 가리킨다. 재고 중에 두 번째로 좋은 머리라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:471
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Chicken"
msgstr "닭"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:472
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Hero's Head"
msgstr "영웅의 머리"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Dog's Head"
msgstr "개 머리"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "광대"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Gnome Zone"
msgstr "노움 존"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Robot Head"
msgstr "로봇 머리"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Alien"
msgstr "외계인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Tiny Beaver Head"
msgstr "쪼끄만 비버 머리"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:479
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "A Skull"
msgstr "해골"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:480
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Bodybuilder"
msgstr "보디빌더"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:481
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Mall Cop"
msgstr "쇼핑몰 경비원"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Mad Doctor"
msgstr "미친 의사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:492
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Keep old head"
msgstr "원래 머리를 유지한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:498
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Great! Here's what I have ready to go.\r\n"
"\tLet me know which head you're interested in! I only have time for one transplant. I'm going "
msgstr ""
"좋아! 지금 준비된 건 이거야.\r\n"
"\t어떤 머리가 끌리는지 말해 줘! 이식은 딱 한 번만 할 시간이 있어. 이거 끝나면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "GOLFING"
msgstr "골프"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid " after this because I'm a "
msgstr " 치러 가야 하거든. 난 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "DOCTOR."
msgstr "의사니까."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "A Brand New Head"
msgstr "새 머리"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:508
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Reputable Doctor"
msgstr "믿을 만한 의사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:511
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "It's a doctor. A "
msgstr "의사다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:511
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "REAL"
msgstr "진짜"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:511
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
" doctor, he's wearing a doctor outfit and everything! \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 의사, 의사 가운이며 뭐며 다 입고 있다! \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:512
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"Let's cut right to the chase... I can replace your head with a better head. "
msgstr "바로 본론으로 들어가지... 네 머리를 더 좋은 머리로 바꿔 줄 수 있어. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:514
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Wait a second... get out of here! I'm not a vet!"
msgstr "잠깐만... 나가! 난 수의사가 아니라고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:516
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid ""
"I'm NOT mad! But I am going mad, so there's a pretty big discount. Only 5 "
"food!"
msgstr "난 미치지 않았어! 하지만 미쳐 가는 중이라, 할인을 꽤 많이 해 주지. 식량 5만!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:520
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Looks like you're stuck with your old head."
msgstr "원래 머리로 살아야 할 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
msgid "Leave in great shame"
msgstr "크나큰 수치 속에 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/rare.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/rare.df"
